1
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:41,920
Sheng,

2
00:01:42,959 --> 00:01:44,799
don't forget the way home.

3
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,799
Come back and see me often.

4
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:50,040
Ms. Yan has us growing produce

5
00:01:51,079 --> 00:01:52,400
for Bofeng House.

6
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,239
Life's been easier now.

7
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,760
Don't worry about me.

8
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,519
I'll be just fine

9
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,319
on my own.

10
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:06,000
Sheng,

11
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,719
will you run

12
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,079
into someone

13
00:02:09,079 --> 00:02:10,359
named Huang Bo?

14
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,159
He was about your age

15
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,120
and a very,

16
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,879
very good man.

17
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,800
If you two do meet,

18
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,759
please look after each other.

19
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,199
Don't move.

20
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:36,280
I'm just checking your heartbeat

21
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:38,199
to see how you're recovering.

22
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,280
No need to thank me.

23
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:43,400
I'm Luo.

24
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:45,039
I live in Skyvale.

25
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,280
What's your name?

26
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,560
Huang Bo.

27
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,400
Huang Bo?

28
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,280
Ms. Luo,

29
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,680
these are for you.

30
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:00,319
Thanks.

31
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,599
Does it look bad?

32
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:09,560
It's beautiful.

33
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,039
I've never seen a flower crown

34
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,719
like it.

35
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,400
Is it pretty?

36
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:28,280
Stunning.

37
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,199
Master.

38
00:04:30,399 --> 00:04:31,199
Zhili.

39
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,160
I came to pay my condolences.

40
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,560
She was still so young.

41
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:56,439
Why did it have to be her?

42
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:58,759
Why?

43
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,160
Master,

44
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,160
why was there an assassin?

45
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,120
It wasn't an assassin.

46
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:10,480
A thief broke in.

47
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:12,519
I heard

48
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,600
something that night

49
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,639
and went to check.

50
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,160
The thief

51
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,959
drew a blade.

52
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:22,000
Lingyi...

53
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:24,879
Lingyi...

54
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,240
Lingyi...

55
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,120
She took the blade for me.

56
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,079
My lord!

57
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,600
My lord!

58
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:35,800
My lord,

59
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,399
the doctor said

60
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,879
Madam was pregnant a month ago.

61
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:47,759
Master,

62
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,439
My lord.

63
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,279
what's wrong?

64
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:53,319
Lingyi,

65
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,279
why didn't you tell me

66
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,040
you were carrying our child?

67
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:07,240
If you'd stayed in your room that night,

68
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,040
none of this would've happened.

69
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,879
But now...

70
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:14,680
I've lost you both.

71
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:20,879
It's my fault.

72
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,279
It's all my fault.

73
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:25,439
I couldn't protect you.

74
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:26,879
I failed you!

75
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,519
I failed our kid!

76
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,560
I failed you!

77
00:06:31,519 --> 00:06:32,800
I failed our kid!

78
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,680
I failed you!

79
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,480
Master,

80
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:37,399
I know you're grieving,

81
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,519
but those still living must go on.

82
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,879
Please take care of yourself.

83
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:48,959
You're too young

84
00:06:50,519 --> 00:06:52,399
to understand how painful

85
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:55,319
a lifetime alone can be.

86
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:57,600
This road

87
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,879
is too hard to walk alone.

88
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,519
Chancellor Gu, my condolences.

89
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,199
Chancellor Gu,

90
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:33,519
His Majesty understands your grief.

91
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:34,959
He's sent me with a message.

92
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,800
You're granted seven days

93
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,680
away from court

94
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,639
to arrange the funeral.

95
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,680
Mrs. Gu's passing was so sudden.

96
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:42,920
No one could've foreseen it.

97
00:07:43,279 --> 00:07:45,399
If you need anything, just ask.

98
00:07:47,519 --> 00:07:48,839
I'm deeply grateful

99
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:51,680
for His Majesty's grace.

100
00:07:54,519 --> 00:07:55,240
Zhili,

101
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,079
let's go.

102
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,639
Chancellor Gu loved his wife deeply.

103
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,560
Let them have some time alone.

104
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,240
Master,

105
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,519
Mrs. Gu would never

106
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:14,000
want to see you suffer like this.

107
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,120
I'll take my leave.

108
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,800
Baby!

109
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,839
My baby!

110
00:08:32,079 --> 00:08:34,120
My baby!

111
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,759
My baby!

112
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,360
Imperial decree arrives!

113
00:09:01,559 --> 00:09:04,120
All of you, hear this decree.

114
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:08,720
Since Meng Tinghui

115
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,360
took charge of this bureau,

116
00:09:10,519 --> 00:09:13,440
she's devoted herself to her duties.

117
00:09:13,559 --> 00:09:16,399
Her talent is rare, her insight far-reaching.

118
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,200
She's resolved my difficulties

119
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,960
and becomes my trusted minister.

120
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,679
This time, she has eliminated criminals,

121
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:24,759
rendered great service,

122
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,240
and saved my life.

123
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,320
Her outstanding merits

124
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:29,039
have earned my favor.

125
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,240
To commend her loyalty and courage,

126
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:33,159
I hereby promote her

127
00:09:33,159 --> 00:09:35,080
to Director of Surveillance Bureau,

128
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,639
with the rank of Third Grade,

129
00:09:37,679 --> 00:09:39,120
and grant her double salary.

130
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:43,399
Women's Provincial Exam predictions!

131
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,279
Starting bid, 30 taels of silver.

132
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,399
Don't!

133
00:09:51,799 --> 00:09:53,679
[I've worked so hard.]

134
00:09:54,039 --> 00:09:55,720
[I've truly done my best.]

135
00:09:56,519 --> 00:09:57,679
[In this world,]

136
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,720
[the shameless]

137
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,120
outlive the reckless.

138
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:23,720
The world is shrouded in darkness,

139
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,080
and justice has yet to come.

140
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,879
Since women were allowed to hold office,

141
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,279
few female officials

142
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:32,639
have risen to the top.

143
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:34,240
Women should stay home

144
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,559
and tend to their families.

145
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:36,840
A walking disaster!

146
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,279
A wicked temptress!

147
00:10:38,519 --> 00:10:40,159
Heaven shows no mercy,

148
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,080
and tears stain my robes!

149
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:44,000
I swear it with my blood.

150
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,320
If I fail the palace exam,

151
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:46,879
I'll willingly be reduced to an entertainer.

152
00:10:51,399 --> 00:10:52,840
Let the storm rage.

153
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,879
[I fear nothing.]

154
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,960
I'll become the sword

155
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,879
that breaks the darkness!

156
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:12,360
Execute!

157
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:26,600
[Tinghui.]

158
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,560
[Lady Meng.]

159
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:27,039
[Top Scholar Meng.]

160
00:11:27,679 --> 00:11:28,159
[Ms. Meng.]

161
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:30,480
- [Lady Meng.]
- [Metropolitan Champion Meng.]

162
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,080
[Tinghui.]

163
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:32,440
[Top Scholar Meng.]

164
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:33,919
[Ms. Meng.]

165
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:34,759
[Top Scholar Meng.]

166
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:45,200
I promote Shen Zhili and Yin Qing

167
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:47,159
to serve as Left and Right Supervisors

168
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:48,000
of Surveillance Bureau.

169
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,360
Both shall likewise receive double salary.

170
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,759
May Meng Tinghui,

171
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:52,279
Shen Zhili, and Yin Qing

172
00:11:52,279 --> 00:11:54,600
continue to uphold justice,

173
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,639
investigate criminals,

174
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:56,960
safeguard the laws of the court,

175
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,200
ease my burdens,

176
00:11:58,399 --> 00:12:00,240
and serve the people.

177
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:02,919
Thank His Majesty for this grace.

178
00:12:13,159 --> 00:12:14,320
We've come this far together.

179
00:12:15,039 --> 00:12:16,000
I owe it all to you.

180
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:17,559
I should be

181
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,679
the one thanking you.

182
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,919
Without you,

183
00:12:20,159 --> 00:12:21,080
I'd probably have spent my life

184
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:21,519
as an

185
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:22,759
ordinary Imperial Academy scholar.

186
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,559
Lady Meng, working with you

187
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:25,720
has shown me things

188
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,360
I never even dreamed of before.

189
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:29,799
I've never regretted joining this bureau.

190
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:31,720
Hold on.

191
00:12:33,039 --> 00:12:34,440
Still calling her Lady Meng?

192
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:37,279
You should call her Director Meng now.

193
00:12:39,399 --> 00:12:41,120
Thank you for taking me in.

194
00:12:41,159 --> 00:12:42,919
I knew you were

195
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,360
a diamond in the rough

196
00:12:44,399 --> 00:12:45,399
and were bound to shine.

197
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:46,559
With Director Meng leading us,

198
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,159
good things keep coming

199
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,159
our way,

200
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,519
and even

201
00:12:50,519 --> 00:12:52,120
our careers keep rising.

202
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:55,559
Wait,

203
00:12:56,799 --> 00:12:58,399
what rank did I just get promoted to?

204
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:03,039
Supervisor Yin.

205
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:05,360
To Director Meng.

206
00:13:05,399 --> 00:13:06,519
To Supervisor Shen.

207
00:13:06,679 --> 00:13:08,440
To Supervisor Yin.

208
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:20,279
Though we've caught Ling Yunfei,

209
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:21,639
we still need

210
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,000
to find out who is backing him.

211
00:13:23,519 --> 00:13:24,320
Director Meng,

212
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,360
the items are here.

213
00:13:30,799 --> 00:13:32,440
I gave you the day off.

214
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:34,639
Why are you still working the case?

215
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,159
Greetings, Your Majesty.

216
00:13:37,279 --> 00:13:37,799
No formalities.

217
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:40,200
You know Director Meng, Your Majesty.

218
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,360
She won't rest

219
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,080
until the case is closed.

220
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:45,159
What brings you here,

221
00:13:45,679 --> 00:13:46,639
Your Majesty?

222
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:47,679
What?

223
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,960
Must I have a reason to see you...

224
00:13:51,399 --> 00:13:52,080
you all?

225
00:14:03,279 --> 00:14:04,279
Please don't misunderstand.

226
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:06,080
These aren't ours.

227
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,399
They were seized from

228
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:08,720
Nightbloom Pavilion and Tiger Roar Gang.

229
00:14:08,919 --> 00:14:10,039
Of course I know.

230
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,879
With Director Meng watching,

231
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:13,320
who would dare line their pockets?

232
00:14:15,879 --> 00:14:16,399
We examined

233
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:17,559
them before

234
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,799
and found nothing.

235
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:20,440
We're checking them again.

236
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:26,000
Is something wrong with it?

237
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:28,279
This pendant was tribute from Northsunder.

238
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:30,440
There were only two,

239
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,039
and Father gave one to

240
00:14:32,039 --> 00:14:33,279
each of the current chancellors.

241
00:14:33,279 --> 00:14:34,279
If one of the chancellors

242
00:14:34,279 --> 00:14:35,360
is backing Ling Yunfei,

243
00:14:35,639 --> 00:14:37,120
no wonder he's so

244
00:14:37,279 --> 00:14:37,720
bold and arrogant.

245
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,799
It can't be my master!

246
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,559
Do you recognize this pendant?

247
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:57,600
You never got to see

248
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,200
Liu Ruyan's body, right?

249
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,679
Her killer bashed in

250
00:15:02,039 --> 00:15:04,360
her skull repeatedly

251
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,960
with a candlestick.

252
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,279
Blood covered

253
00:15:08,279 --> 00:15:09,799
her face and pooled

254
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,600
across the floor.

255
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,679
She cared

256
00:15:12,679 --> 00:15:14,320
so much about her looks,

257
00:15:14,639 --> 00:15:16,399
yet even her face

258
00:15:16,399 --> 00:15:17,279
was destroyed.

259
00:15:17,639 --> 00:15:18,600
What kind

260
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:22,320
of hatred could drive someone

261
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,960
to such cruelty?

262
00:15:25,399 --> 00:15:26,960
Shut up, Meng Tinghui!

263
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:27,919
Shut up!

264
00:15:27,919 --> 00:15:28,759
Even when she was dying,

265
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:29,840
Liu Ruyan was thinking of you.

266
00:15:30,159 --> 00:15:31,279
She tried to

267
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,240
tell you who killed her.

268
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:34,879
She tore

269
00:15:35,399 --> 00:15:37,200
this pendant from her killer

270
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,200
while fighting for her life.

271
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,360
Recognize it now?

272
00:15:44,639 --> 00:15:46,399
There are only two cat's eye pendants.

273
00:15:46,759 --> 00:15:48,639
The late emperor gave one to each chancellor.

274
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,080
The killer

275
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:52,080
is either Chancellor Xu

276
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,279
or Chancellor Gu.

277
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:54,960
No!

278
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:56,080
Shut your mouth!

279
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:56,799
Ling Yunfei,

280
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,320
don't you understand?

281
00:15:58,720 --> 00:15:59,960
He killed Liu Ruyan

282
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:02,360
because I'd traced the case back to her.

283
00:16:02,759 --> 00:16:03,679
He knew how much

284
00:16:03,679 --> 00:16:04,759
she meant to you,

285
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,960
but he killed her anyway.

286
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,399
He was never

287
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:10,159
protecting you.

288
00:16:10,159 --> 00:16:10,600
Shut up!

289
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,320
He was protecting himself.

290
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:12,600
Shut the fuck up!

291
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:13,440
Give me his name.

292
00:16:13,759 --> 00:16:15,519
We can avenge Liu Ruyan together.

293
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:23,200
Meng Tinghui,

294
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,799
haven't you always wanted me dead?

295
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,360
Kill me.

296
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:31,679
He never cares about you.

297
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,440
Why keep his secret and protect him

298
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,399
at all costs?

299
00:16:35,919 --> 00:16:36,960
To him, you're nothing

300
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:39,639
