301
00:16:43,879 --> 00:16:44,879
Meng Tinghui,

302
00:16:46,799 --> 00:16:47,519
you're just

303
00:16:47,519 --> 00:16:49,200
the emperor's lapdog.

304
00:16:55,919 --> 00:16:57,519
Assassins sent by Thrallbarrow this time

305
