as the Crimson Conclave assassins

308
00:17:01,279 --> 00:17:02,320
Zhishu encountered before.

309
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:05,000
And they deliberately avoided Meng Tinghui.

310
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:07,120
Her identity as Princess of Midvale

311
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:08,399
