317
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,200
Spies from Midvale have long

318
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,359
been hidden by her side,

319
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:19,799
waiting for the chance to strike.

320
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:21,799
