339
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,400
That's why she had an immunity

340
00:18:00,559 --> 00:18:01,839
to the drug and survived.

341
00:18:02,279 --> 00:18:04,000
Meng Tinghui has offered her blood

342
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,119
