347
00:18:11,160 --> 00:18:13,000
And why would Meng Tinghui do this?

348
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,799
But as long as the Crimson Conclave remains,

349
00:18:14,799 --> 00:18:15,720
Meng Tinghui will be a blade

350
