At any time, she could turn against you.

352
00:18:20,119 --> 00:18:21,839
His Late Majesty acted with great foresight.

353
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:23,640
He made the Midvale's royals slaves

354
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:24,759
and forbade them from holding office,

355
00:18:24,759 --> 00:18:26,519
to prevent future threats.

356
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:27,799
Yet Your Majesty insists

357
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:28,880
