Ms. Meng almost died protecting His Majesty.

363
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:37,400
People can be deceiving.

364
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,279
We must always be cautious.

365
00:18:38,599 --> 00:18:40,079
If everyone were as naive as you,

366
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:40,759
