377
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,039
The Crimson Conclave already

378
00:19:12,039 --> 00:19:13,000
knows Meng Tinghui's identity,

379
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,559
yet they let her stay

380
00:19:14,559 --> 00:19:15,720
by Your Majesty's side

381
