and become a key official.

382
00:19:17,319 --> 00:19:20,000
They must be plotting to restore Midvale.

383
00:19:20,319 --> 00:19:21,000
Precisely because

384
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,319
the Crimson Conclave lurks in dark,

385
00:19:22,319 --> 00:19:23,400
watching and waiting,

386
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,079
I must keep her by my side.

387
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:26,680
Only then will they dare not act rashly.

388
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:28,559
It's also

389
00:19:28,559 --> 00:19:30,240
a way to keep them in check.

390
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,160
Your Majesty,

391
00:19:31,319 --> 00:19:32,000
the Huiyin Studio...

392
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:33,200
Take Di Nian with you

393
00:19:33,279 --> 00:19:34,519
