394
00:19:35,079 --> 00:19:36,079
The Crimson Conclave is cunning.

395
00:19:36,079 --> 00:19:37,319
They're likely already gone.

396
00:19:37,319 --> 00:19:38,440
But even so,

397
00:19:39,079 --> 00:19:40,480
we must investigate this thoroughly.

398
00:19:41,279 --> 00:19:41,880
Yes, Your Majesty.

399
00:20:18,519 --> 00:20:19,640
Do either

400
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,519
of you recognize this?

401
00:20:26,119 --> 00:20:26,920
The cat's eye pendant?

402
00:20:29,119 --> 00:20:29,839
Your Majesty,

403
