410
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:52,319
I carelessly lost mine.

411
00:20:52,319 --> 00:20:53,359
Where did you lose it?

412
00:20:53,799 --> 00:20:55,480
It was an oversight.

413
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,799
I honestly can't recall.

414
00:20:58,079 --> 00:20:59,880
