415
00:21:01,119 --> 00:21:02,279
Please forgive me.

416
00:21:02,359 --> 00:21:03,880
So this is yours, Chancellor Xu?

417
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:06,119
Where is yours, Chancellor Gu?

418
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:11,440
Your Majesty,

419
00:21:12,759 --> 00:21:13,640
all my wife

420
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:15,640
ever wanted was

421
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,839
