427
00:21:26,559 --> 00:21:28,960
to honor the throne and be grateful.

428
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:31,799
I couldn't bear the thought

429
00:21:31,799 --> 00:21:32,559
of her dying alone.

430
00:21:33,640 --> 00:21:34,480
Your Majesty,

431
