so I

432
00:21:39,279 --> 00:21:40,720
buried that pendant

433
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:43,200
with her,

434
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:45,480
hoping she would still

435
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,079
feel me by her side.

436
00:21:58,240 --> 00:22:00,039
You were always devoted

437
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:01,319
to your wife.

438
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:02,720
I won't hold this against you.

439
00:22:04,319 --> 00:22:05,079
Thanks, Your Majesty.

440
00:22:06,119 --> 00:22:07,839
Guard this well, Chancellor Xu.

441
00:22:09,160 --> 00:22:10,039
It was

442
00:22:10,039 --> 00:22:11,680
a gift from the late emperor.

443
00:22:11,799 --> 00:22:12,920
Lose it again,

444
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,000
and you may

445
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,599
