454
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,920
and see that justice is done.

455
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:41,920
Yes.

456
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:42,960
Yes, Your Majesty.

457
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:44,960
