473
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,920
Situ Xue was a spy from Midvale.

474
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:48,440
Huiyin Studio is

475
00:23:48,799 --> 00:23:50,400
where Crimson Conclave gathered

476
00:23:50,839 --> 00:23:52,640
