484
00:24:33,039 --> 00:24:33,920
They're only dreams.

485
00:24:34,359 --> 00:24:35,400
Don't dwell on them.

486
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,200
Tomorrow, I'll take you

487
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,440
