513
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:22,480
Since you put it that way,

514
00:26:23,160 --> 00:26:24,559
I'll accept

515
00:26:24,759 --> 00:26:25,799
this gift.

516
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:47,279
When I first met you,

517
00:26:48,119 --> 00:26:50,359
