I know how hard you fought

526
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,839
to come this far.

527
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:19,200
As emperor, I'm used to

528
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:22,200
weighing gains and losses

529
00:27:22,599 --> 00:27:24,480
and burying feelings in my heart.

530
00:27:25,079 --> 00:27:26,319
I thought

531
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:27,640
nothing in this world

532
00:27:27,640 --> 00:27:29,000
could ever move me again.

533
00:27:29,559 --> 00:27:30,400
But you

534
00:27:32,279 --> 00:27:33,680
found your way into my heart.

535
00:27:35,599 --> 00:27:36,559
Meng Tinghui,

536
00:27:39,079 --> 00:27:40,519
