539
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:52,480
Do you dare?

540
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:55,759
I like you, too.

541
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:57,960
More than yesterday,

542
00:27:59,279 --> 00:28:00,440
and more with each passing day.

543
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:58,319
I'll go to the Surveillance Bureau

544
00:28:59,039 --> 00:29:00,039
