551
00:29:37,559 --> 00:29:39,240
Chancellor Gu, what a rare guest.

552
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:40,680
Meng Tinghui's traced

553
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:41,920
the case to Nightbloom Pavilion.

554
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:43,599
Stop distributing Godsgrain

555
00:29:43,599 --> 00:29:44,640
there at once.

556
00:29:44,880 --> 00:29:46,160
You seriously think

557
00:29:47,079 --> 00:29:48,279
Nightbloom Pavilion is

558
00:29:48,279 --> 00:29:49,599
his only outlet?

559
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:51,839
His business

560
00:29:52,079 --> 00:29:54,160
is beyond your control.

561
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:56,119
If Meng Tinghui uncovers the truth,

562
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:58,279
we'll all go down with him.

563
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:59,759
Fine by me.

564
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,119
I'll be with him,

565
00:30:03,279 --> 00:30:04,599
