566
00:30:04,799 --> 00:30:06,599
He's grown more arrogant over the years

567
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:07,920
and defied

568
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:09,039
my time and again.

569
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:11,359
You turned him against me, you whore!

570
00:30:14,920 --> 00:30:16,279
Whore?

571
00:30:16,759 --> 00:30:17,759
Your father

572
00:30:17,759 --> 00:30:19,880
