573
00:30:20,680 --> 00:30:21,640
was a prostitute

574
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:23,200
when he was besotted with her.

575
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:23,960
Shut up!

576
00:30:25,400 --> 00:30:26,759
If you persist,

577
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:27,960
I will

578
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:29,200
