579
00:30:29,559 --> 00:30:31,319
I have ways to get away with it.

580
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:33,839
Touch him

581
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,240
and I'll drag you

582
00:30:36,079 --> 00:30:37,920
