583
00:30:38,039 --> 00:30:40,160
Then the whole world will see

584
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:43,480
the true face of its virtuous chancellor.

585
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:52,920
You think a lowly whore

586
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,319
like you can threaten me?

587
00:30:55,759 --> 00:30:57,440
You owe your chancellorship

588
00:30:57,680 --> 00:30:58,839
to him.

589
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,440
Without him,

590
00:31:00,839 --> 00:31:02,720
you're nothing but

591
00:31:02,759 --> 00:31:03,799
a worthless fool

592
00:31:03,799 --> 00:31:04,960
in official robes.

593
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:27,880
I killed Liu Ruyan.

594
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:30,680
Sooner or later, he'll give me up.

595
00:31:32,799 --> 00:31:33,880
Killing him now

596
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:36,279
changes nothing.

597
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,319
Leave.

598
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:52,279
I studied hard for ten years.

599
00:31:54,279 --> 00:31:55,680
I had no powerful family behind me

600
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:58,319
and no emperor's favor.

601
00:31:59,279 --> 00:32:00,480
I clawed my way up,

602
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:02,839
step by step.

603
00:32:03,559 --> 00:32:05,119
Meng Tinghui is nothing.

604
00:32:06,359 --> 00:32:07,119
She only got this far

605
00:32:07,119 --> 00:32:08,720
because His Majesty favors her.

606
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,480
But I

607
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:15,079
planned

608
00:32:15,279 --> 00:32:17,000
every step of my rise.

609
00:32:18,440 --> 00:32:19,160
I fought so hard

610
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:20,680
to get where I am,

611
00:32:23,039 --> 00:32:23,960
only

612
00:32:25,839 --> 00:32:26,680
to be brought

613
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:28,000
down by a bastard.

614
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:34,000
Ling Yunfei,

615
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:38,319
you've been my curse since you were born.

616
00:32:39,559 --> 00:32:41,519
I should've let them beat you to death.

617
00:32:43,359 --> 00:32:44,200
And now

618
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:47,599
you're taking me down with you.

619
00:32:49,680 --> 00:32:50,480
You win,

620
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:56,720
Ling Yunfei.

621
00:32:58,039 --> 00:32:58,720
You win.

622
00:33:00,599 --> 00:33:01,400
You win!

623
00:33:20,519 --> 00:33:21,519
You're laughing at me?

624
00:33:28,799 --> 00:33:30,079
Even you?

625
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:33,519
You have no right!

626
00:33:45,119 --> 00:33:46,279
After half a lifetime of plotting,

627
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:49,720
I've ended up with no way out.

628
00:33:51,160 --> 00:33:52,400
I wanted to go down in history,

629
00:33:54,799 --> 00:33:55,960
but it's all for nothing.

630
00:33:57,200 --> 00:33:58,000
I deserve it.

631
00:33:59,359 --> 00:34:00,640
All of it.

632
00:34:43,400 --> 00:34:44,039
Master!

633
00:34:49,119 --> 00:34:49,760
Master,

634
00:34:50,079 --> 00:34:51,119
Mrs. Gu's gone,

635
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:52,599
but you can't throw your life away.

636
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:54,880
She would never want you

637
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:56,239
to hurt yourself like this.

638
00:34:56,840 --> 00:34:57,440
Master,

639
00:34:57,800 --> 00:34:59,039
you'll get through this.

640
00:35:04,559 --> 00:35:05,400
Master,

641
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:08,480
Mrs. Gu would want you to live.

642
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:29,840
Everything will be all right.

643
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:46,280
He's finally caught.

644
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:48,119
Lady Meng really completed the sworn mission.

645
00:35:48,119 --> 00:35:49,239
Now that this villain

646
00:35:49,239 --> 00:35:50,360
will be executed in public,

647
00:35:50,559 --> 00:35:51,199
we won't

648
00:35:51,199 --> 00:35:52,599
have to live in fear anymore!

649
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:53,360
Exactly.

650
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:54,719
- Right.
- Well done, Lady Meng!

651
00:35:54,719 --> 00:35:56,360
Excellent! Well done!

652
00:35:57,559 --> 00:35:58,679
Lady Meng is amazing!

653
00:36:02,039 --> 00:36:02,639
Kneel!

654
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:06,239
Lady Meng is incredible!

655
00:36:10,079 --> 00:36:11,519
Both chancellors are here

656
00:36:12,519 --> 00:36:13,679
to witness my execution.

657
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,079
What an honor.

658
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:16,719
Even in hell, I'd have something

659
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,280
to brag about.

660
00:36:20,559 --> 00:36:22,760
So this is why you had us

661
00:36:22,760 --> 00:36:24,239
oversee the execution?

662
00:36:24,719 --> 00:36:26,079
You wanted us to hear

663
00:36:26,079 --> 00:36:28,480
the crowd sing your praises.

664
00:36:28,719 --> 00:36:30,039
You caught one bandit chief

665
00:36:30,519 --> 00:36:31,880
and think you can

666
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:33,039
flaunt it before me?

667
00:36:40,599 --> 00:36:41,880
Lady Meng's brilliant!

668
00:36:41,890 --> 00:36:43,559
We're proud of you!

669
00:36:43,559 --> 00:36:45,360
- Amazing work!
- Great job!

670
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:47,519
We owe you, Lady Meng!

671
00:36:47,519 --> 00:36:49,039
It's all thanks to Lady Meng!

672
00:36:49,960 --> 00:36:50,840
Ling Yunfei,

673
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:53,320
your enemy

674
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:56,079
is sitting right up there.

675
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:58,760
He killed the woman you loved.

676
00:37:00,039 --> 00:37:02,079
Now he's here to watch you die.

677
00:37:04,719 --> 00:37:05,719
I know you hate him.

678
00:37:06,800 --> 00:37:07,440
This is

679
00:37:07,440 --> 00:37:08,559
your last chance.

680
00:37:09,039 --> 00:37:10,159
Give me his name,

681
00:37:11,119 --> 00:37:12,800
and I'll make sure he dies with you.

682
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:29,119
They're bringing him food?

683
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:30,599
He still gets to eat?

684
00:37:31,519 --> 00:37:33,280
A condemned man still gets a last meal.

685
00:37:34,039 --> 00:37:35,159
Why are you feeding him?

686
00:37:35,760 --> 00:37:37,480
For someone as vicious as Ling Yunfei,

687
00:37:38,719 --> 00:37:39,599
no need for you to

688
00:37:39,599 --> 00:37:40,920
personally bring his last meal.

689
00:37:42,440 --> 00:37:44,199
The worst criminal

690
00:37:44,679 --> 00:37:46,199
and the greatest hero

691
00:37:46,400 --> 00:37:47,519
are both human.

692
00:37:48,079 --> 00:37:49,599
I'm here to oversee this execution,

693
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,599
so I must remain

694
00:37:52,039 --> 00:37:52,960
impartial.

695
00:37:53,079 --> 00:37:54,760
Ling Yunfei is condemned,

696
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:56,000
but the rules

697
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,639
still apply to him.

698
00:37:59,800 --> 00:38:01,159
Chancellor Gu is right!

699
00:38:01,639 --> 00:38:02,280
Well said!

700
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:15,079
Beat him!

701
00:38:21,880 --> 00:38:22,599
Don't you

702
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:23,920
dare touch my little brother!

703
00:38:30,760 --> 00:38:31,360
Yunfei,

704
00:38:31,760 --> 00:38:32,480
are you hurt?

705
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,199
I'm your brother.

706
00:38:40,239 --> 00:38:40,719
Here.

707
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:43,719
It's delicious.

708
00:38:51,519 --> 00:38:52,039
Slow down.

709
00:38:53,079 --> 00:38:53,840
Don't choke.

710
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:57,079
Aren't you

711
00:38:57,280 --> 00:38:58,360
going to eat?

712
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:00,679
I'm not hungry.

713
00:39:01,039 --> 00:39:01,800
You have it.

714
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:13,280
This tastes exactly

715
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:17,480
the same as 20 years ago.
